---
import { differenceCards } from "../data/site-content";
---

<section class="bg-[#f3f3f3] py-20 md:py-24">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">The Zorakle Difference</p>
    <h2 class="section-title max-w-4xl">
      Why Zorakle isn't another assessment tool.
    </h2>

    <div class="relative mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[34px] bg-white px-6 py-8 shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(34,37,42,0.08)] md:mt-12 md:px-10 md:py-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 md:items-center">
        {/* Graphic - Left */}
        <div class="relative h-80 md:h-96">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" class="w-full h-full" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
            {/* Center: SpotOn! Fit */}
            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="60" fill="#17c4a3" opacity="0.95"/>
            <text x="200" y="200" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="white" font-family="display">SpotOn!</text>
            <text x="200" y="225" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="white" font-family="display">Fit</text>

            {/* 7 Sciences arranged in circle */}
            {/* Science 1: Values - Top Left */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="80" cy="80" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="80" y="82" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Values</text>
              <line x1="112" y1="112" x2="157" y2="157" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>

            {/* Science 2: Stages - Top */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="200" cy="55" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="200" y="49" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Stages of</text>
              <text x="200" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Growth</text>
              <line x1="200" y1="100" x2="200" y2="140" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>

            {/* Science 3: Culture - Top Right */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="320" cy="80" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="320" y="80" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Culture</text>
              <line x1="288" y1="112" x2="243" y2="157" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>

            {/* Science 4: Work Style - Right */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="340" cy="200" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="340" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Work</text>
              <text x="340" y="209" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Style</text>
              <line x1="295" y1="200" x2="260" y2="200" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>

            {/* Science 5: EQ/SQ - Bottom Right */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="320" cy="320" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="320" y="313" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Emotional &</text>
              <text x="320" y="329" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Social IQ</text>
              <line x1="288" y1="288" x2="243" y2="243" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>

            {/* Science 6: Focus - Bottom Left */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="80" cy="320" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="80" y="313" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Focus</text>
              <text x="80" y="329" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Preference</text>
              <line x1="112" y1="288" x2="157" y2="243" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>

            {/* Science 7: Competencies - Left */}
            <g>
              <circle cx="60" cy="200" r="45" fill="#b6bbc2"/>
              <text x="60" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Core</text>
              <text x="60" y="209" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="white">Competencies</text>
              <line x1="105" y1="200" x2="140" y2="200" stroke="#17c4a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>

        {/* Text - Right */}
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#3b3e47] md:text-[18px]">
            <span class="font-display mr-2 text-[18px] font-semibold text-[#09cc9c]">Founded on science.</span>
            Zorakle applies seven validated sciences—behavioral, psychological, and organizational—to understand what drives franchisee success and franchisor performance.
          </p>

          <p class="text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#3b3e47] md:text-[18px]">
            <span class="font-display mr-2 text-[18px] font-semibold text-[#09cc9c]">Audit-driven insight.</span>
            We don't use personality profiles. Instead, we conduct deep audits of your franchisor strategy, culture, support systems, and current franchisee cohort to identify what actually drives performance in your system.
          </p>

          <p class="text-[16px] leading-8 text-[#3b3e47] md:text-[18px]">
            <span class="font-display mr-2 text-[18px] font-semibold text-[#09cc9c]">Algorithmic precision.</span>
            From those insights, we build your unique ideal franchisee algorithm—a blueprint that predicts which candidates will thrive, struggle, or fail in your specific system, not a generic one-size-fits-all model.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:mt-12">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="#">Sign Up Now!</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary btn-secondary-dark" href="/schedule">Book a Demo</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
